# NLS79: Demographic disparities in 1985 median wealth AMONG ever-incarcerated

Data: data/nls_incarceration_processed.csv (n=12013). 'hipanic'->'hispanic' normalized.
Primary group ever_jailed=1: n=289 (male=252, female=37). Estimator=median; CI=percentile bootstrap (B=5000); p=permutation (B=10000).

## Within ever_jailed=1: by SEX

| sex | n | median 1985 wealth | 95% CI |
|---|---|---|---|
| male | 252 | 1,000 | [320, 1,400] |
| female | 37 | 0 | [0, 0] |

**male - female** = 1,000 (95%CI [-2,400, 968]); permutation p=0.1868; Mann-Whitney p=0.0281

